<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1OP - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">1 Opita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Mbaa OPITA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Opita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 P</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Mbaa OPITA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Mbaa Opita kwɔle o ka laa Wambwalu, umba bɔkɔ o ya mba tee &lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa,&gt;&gt; umba bɔkɔ o kpashaa munamuna mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya Omayino awu. O ka kwupu kwɔlɛ te kaa lo ka wambwalu ɛnwu ma kwuwongu inyashi iyi o yi mu imama kwuwongu ikwidufulo mbo. U ka kwupu kwɔlɛ e lolo mbo meka iyi Ilɔ Iyesheshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ lukwu wu, iyimo mu kwuvɔ wu mbala iso ishimɛzhi iyi igbama wu i shi mbo eyifulomo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mba lo yidu mbala inyashi iyi o yi mu imama, moo inyi gba akwu ipwama iyi ikwidufulo mbo le akwɛyi o shi mbo rigbɛ ɔnuwu &lt;&lt;Kwɔfyi ungwu igbama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ip">E kyo a za mba tee lo zɛ luzɛ undu lu fa laa enzu umba Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ilolomo Meka Iyi Isama Iyi Ukpo (1.3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iŋɔma Ɛsɛsɛ (1.13—2.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiya Ingyi Bɔkɔ I Fatee Umbwalu Le Wo Kwuyengwu Inyashi Imama (2.11—4.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Igba La Ɛnwu Mɛzhi Iyi Umbwalu Mbala Ɛduma (5.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama Iyi Iso (5.12-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Imi Opita, uzilɔ uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba mi ka yi kwupu kwɔlɛ le,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Lunyi enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo gba a ŋa yi le awu, bɔkɔ lu kwu agboga mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, bɔkɔ lu kpashaa lu yi mu ɛzhi iyi Ɔpɔtu mbala Ogalatiya mbala Okapadosiya mbala Eshiya mbala Obitiniya awu. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Lunyi Ukpo a ŋa yi mu iyitu wiyi keyi, mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e wo ma yi bɔkɔ a vyɛ yi ma mu ɛnzhi umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kwuwo ungwu lu mbwalu wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Esheshi mbala egbo inɔma gyɔɔ li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eyifulomo Ireyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />La ki du Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ete wu Ɔkwu nzu ma, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu! U wu e shi nzu kwunyɔ ungwepo kwuwongu eyembembyi wu iyɛku. Kekelele ki yi eyifulomo ŋa kwuwongu iyimo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Ki kyo ki yi ogu uwu apula iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ i kpɛdɔma mo, i tutumo mo ba i kpo ngbangbaa mo, iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e she nzu moshi. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ekpasu iyi Ukpo gba i ye yi mu igbomo le nzhii ba ɔnuwu bɔkɔ lu bu na isama iyi bɔkɔ o bo ta yanduu ɔnuwu bɔkɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu bi bomo awu. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Lu ma inyashi iyi kwuye bwɛɛ kwuwongu ipwama ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi bɔkɔ i du yi; tetete la lu mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ kwuwongu iyeshi iyi Ukpo e wo yi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i du yi te kaa lo pwa ikwu idu lu fulo yi ireyi ma, iyi bɔkɔ isheshi i ka ogolu ma awu. Ogolu uwu bɔkɔ e kpɛdɔma lala enzu o ma inyashi o lo wu mu ɔyi kaa lo ma shi akwu uwu eshi nana akwu uwura ŋa. Gba lu tama mu ipwama iyi ikwu idu lu fulo yi ɛlɛ mo, luu fya ipwɔma mbaa Ukpo kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi a ba gbama awu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi lala lu du ma wu dɛ mo, tetete ba, lu kpo lukwu wu; kekelele la lu ye wu mu imama mo, tetete lu nyama la wu la ɔnyɛ uwakwu uwu bɔkɔ onzu e do te e so mo. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Isama iyi kwunyɔ yi gba akwu rigbɛ ingyi lu yi mu inama le kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Mɛka iyi iso iyi isama ɛlɛ, anukenzu umba bɔkɔ o siso mɛka iyi esheshi iyi i bi nyɔ awu, o yese mo ɔ gagya ngbɛɛ mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo iyi Ukpo e be shi yi, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />kaa lo yitu iyi kwuye mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i bi wo kwuye kwɔngu, iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ e yi mamba awu, e ye mbo mu izɔma te lo so. Moo Kwundu e so mbo e shi mɛzhi-e te Okrasi a ma inyashi akwɛyi mizhikembo yi, Ukpo e shi wu inzumbɛku. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ anukenzu o so iso mekeka iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ lu pwa mafyi iyi wa zɛ ilɔ umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi umba bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi mbo o so yi iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu. Ukpo a zɔ mba te ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ o yi mu iwomo le, akwu kwuwongu ɛmba mo, akwu kwuwo yi. Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo lala ɔ gyi te lo yitu iyi apula ɛlɛ tete.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">La Lu Yi Sɛsɛsɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu nɔngɔ egbo yi ma kwuwongu ɛduma; la lu yi ɛnwu yi ma gbagiri; la lu fulo eyi yi lɛɛbi mu esheshi iyi Ukpo e be shi yi kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a ba gbama awu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Kekelele bɔkɔ lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo umba ilomo ŋa le, la lu mbwalu ari iyira kyamate kwuyengwu lu yi mu ipwu awu fo. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma awu ba e yi sɛsɛ awu, lunyi tete la lu yi sɛsɛ mu apula yi iwomo lɛɛbi; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />moo o ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee: &lt;&lt;La lu yi sɛsɛ, moo Imi mi yi sɛsɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Lu ya wu tee Ada, kwuyengwu lu lɛ Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ kwusɛ kwuyengwu e yese ɛduma iyi onzu uwunawuna mo. Kwuwo kwɔngu, la lu ŋɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kyamate agboga tayi la iyi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Moo lu yitu te akwu mu apula iyi bɔkɔ i kpɛdɔma kyamate esiliva nana egolu gba Ukpo a ra yi gba a wa yi ma mu rinye ingyi ukwu uwu umbwa uwu bɔkɔ asɔkwu yi o shi yi mo; <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />akwu mu ɛnzhi umba abwa umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, umba bɔkɔ o yi kyamate ɛnzhi umba ilɔ uwu e yi ofya mo, ba e yi kwuto mu ɛnwu wu mo tayi gba o wa yi ma le. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ukpo a ŋa wu dɛ ishi e be wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le, tetete a zɔ wu mu kwudu mu kwuyengwu imbwambwa kwɔlɛ kwuwo yi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Lu zɛ ma wu gba lu yitu iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ akwɛyi e shi wu inzumbɛku le. Ɛlɛ gba i shi ikwu idu lu fulo yi mbala eyifulomo yi, i yi mu Ukpo le.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Kekelele bɔkɔ lu wulu egbo yi ma sɛsɛsɛ mu ongbulolo uwu iso iyi Ukpo imbwaluma akwɛyi lu yi idɛnyi iyeshi la wa mbwalu-o le, la lu gyi esu mu egbo yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Moo kwunyɔ ungwepo ungwu Ukpo e shi yi ele, akwu mu kiya ki kpɛdɔma gba lu fya ngwu le mo, akwu mu iso iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i kpɛdɔma mo iyɔkpɔɔ awu, gba lu fya kwunyɔ ungwepo le. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Moo iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Enzu lɛɛbi o yi kyamate</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ɔsɛ tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">woshi mbo ba u yi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">kyamate edodo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">iyi ɛzhi ɛngbarara tayi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ɔsɛ u shirima akwɛyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">edodo i fumo mɛzhi,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />iso iyi Ukpo ba i yi iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Iso iyi eshi ɛlɛ gba ba ɔ ta yi anu yi le.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwoki Kwureyi Mbala Enzu Wasɛsɛ Umba Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu lafya laa ira iyinayina,mbala anya mbala kwukyoro mbala rise mbala ikyɛma. mbala Onzu i tutumo. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />La lu wo lonzu undu iso iyi Ukpo ɛsɛsɛ kyamate ɛmɛ umbelu o wo lonzu undu kwɔmɛ tayi. Iyi i shi yi lu bulɔma kaa la lu fya isama. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Kyamate iso iyi Ukpo i so tee, &lt;&lt;Kekelele lu yitu-o tee Ukpo e shoshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Tabɔkɔ lu bo mbaa Ɔkwu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi kyamate kwokyi kwureyi ungwu bɔkɔ enzu o towo ngwu mo, ungwu Ukpo a ŋa ba kwu she wu awu, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />lunyi tete lu yi kyamate ekyi ireyi tayi. Lunyi gba Ukpo a ra yi e yi mu kwogba wu imbomo. Ukpo a ŋa yi kaa la lu kwu uzhi uwu ebwoshi wakɛrikɛri umba bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ iyi iduma iyi bɔkɔ i she la Ukpo mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Yese, mi bɔ kwokyi mu Ɔzayɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ungwu mi ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">ungwu abwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ungwu ɔla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">onzu uwu bɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">a nyama la wu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">lovya lu wo wu mo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kwokyi kwɔlɛ, lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu idu lu fulo mawu awu, kwokyi kwɔlɛ kwu sa yi ma, umba bɔkɔ ɔ mbwalu mo ba iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kwokyi ungwu bɔkɔ wa mbo igwu o towo ngwu mo te akwu ungwu umbwa awu gba kwu kwu ɔla uwu ugu le ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Iso iyi Ukpo i gba i so kpɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Kwoki ungwu kwu shi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">enzu o tama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">mbala ɔzɔ uwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">u shi mbo o kpa mɛzhi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">O kpa mɛzhi kwuwongu o towo iso iyi Ukpo imbwaluma. Ɛlɛ gba Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi te i du mbo le.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Lunyi ba lu kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mafyi wu, lu kwu ebwoshi umba Edego-ala, lu kwu ɛdɔ iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa yi kaa la lu gbo wu ɔya. Ukpo a ŋa yi, akwɛyi a wa yi ma mu ipwu e bo ye mu ɛbɛ iyɛku awu, e wo tayi kaa la lu tanu iyi esheshi wu mba enzu. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Mekyi, lunyi lu kwu enzu umba Ukpo mo, kekelele lu kwu enzu umba Ukpo ŋa; mekyi lu fya eyembembyi iyi Ukpo mo, kekelele lu fya eyembembyi iyi Ukpo-o.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enye Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ɛmɛza umba idu mi, la lu yitu te lunyi lu kwu agboga mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. Kwuwo kwɔngu, mi kpa yi ɛshɛku tee la lu zɛ gboo mbaa apula iyira iwomo, iyi bɔkɔ i to ewa mbala kwundu yi iyɔkpɔɔ awu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />La lu zɛ luzɛ undesheshi mbaa enzu umba ipwu. Gba lu wo tayi, kwuye ungwu o mulo yi tee lu wo kiya ingyira lala, tetete o ma apula iyesheshi iyi lu wo akwɛyi o du Ukpo ma ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu igbama wu.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Kwuwongwu Ukpo, la lu lomo la atekeyi yi: la ɔsu uwakɔ uwu bɔkɔ a ra la ɛzhi lɛɛbi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />nana agomina umba bɔkɔ o shi mbo tee lo lo enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ira inyashi, umba bɔkɔ o wo iyeshi ba lo pwɔ mba ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Moo Ukpo a gyite la lu wo iyeshi kaa iso iyi bɔkɔ erendo umbenzu o so mu reshi yi awu, li bɔma. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />La lu ŋɔ kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ kwu enye fo tayi. Tetete lunyi ba la lu to ɛlɛ kaa la kwayi ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ lu vye ira yi ma mo; la lu zɛ luzɛ undu bɔkɔ lu fa la ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />La lu lomo la uwewe: La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi ɛmanyi yi wa mbwalu, la lu wiyi iyi Ukpo, la lu lomo la ɔsu uwakɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyashi Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Lunyi enye, la lu to ɛyi lɛɛbi lu shi ada umba kwogba yi mbala ilomo. La lu wo ɛlɛ la ada umba kwogba umba bɔkɔ o shi ari kɛɛkyi mo, umba bɔkɔ o yi wɔnu lala, lu wo mbo tete. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Moo Ukpo a mwɔnyɛ mbala onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yidu mu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i fa te lo lo wu mo, kwuwongu e yitu iyi Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kwupwɔ ungwuna ba lu fya gba o bi yi ɛmwu kwuwongu lu wo ira ba lu yidu? Tatayi gba lu wo kiya ingyira mo, akwɛyi o bi yi ɛmwu, ba lu yidu, lu fya ipwɔma mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Mu ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a ya yi ma le, moo Okrasi lala a ma inyashi kwuwo yi, akwɛyi a zɔ nzu te la ki mbwalu ata wu. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />E ngbomo mo, onzu uwunawuna a pwa imulo mu kenzu wu mo. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o kpa wu ari, a gba yi a kpa mba mo; kwuye ungwu o lo wu inyashi, e lo mbo iyi te uwu a gba yi e wo mbo mo. Uwu ba a ra la ɛnwu e shi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ akwu u zɔ ombu marimari awu. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Okrasi mafyiwu akwu ingbomo nzu ma kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɔ kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. E wo ɛlɛ te kaa la ki yi kyamate ɛkpɛzhi umba enzu tayi, umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo fo akwɛyi ki ŋɔ kaa la ki wo iyi Ukpo a gyi. Kwuwongwu lunɛ undu bɔkɔ ɔ nɛ wu gba o bo yi efya yi ma le. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Moo mekyi lu yi kyamate ilɔ umba bɔkɔ o tomo tayi, kekelele ba lu gbama mbaa U bɔ yi eyi mbala U gbo yi mo.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iŋɔma Iyi Oko Mbala Ɔnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Eko, lunyi la lu lomo la umba anu yi tete, kaa umba bɔkɔ o towo iso iyi Ukpo mo awu, lo na yi ma kwuwongu iwomo iyi eko mbo, moo o so mbo mu kenzu dɛ fo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kwuwongu o ma iwomo yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi mbala ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo ilɛma yi marimari. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ibɔma yi la kwu mu woshi izɔma mbala ɛnwu inɔngɔ ma bi mo, la kwu mu inyi ishimo mbala lɔkyɛ undu abwa ifumo mbala ekpayi iyi abwa ilomo mo. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Iwomo yi li wa la woshi umbu bɔkɔ u sɛma mo, bɔkɔ u yi ɛmbu kwuwo zezeze mu egbo yi awu kwudu. Ɛlɛ gba i she la Ukpo i ka le. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Moo tayi gba ekokpayi umba bɔkɔ o yi sɛsɛ bɔkɔ o shi egbo mbo mu Ukpo mekyi, o zɔ woshi mbo mo le. O lomo la umba anu mba, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />kyamate bɔkɔ Osera e lomo la Aburamu akwɛyi a ya wu te ɔkwu mi tayi. Lunyi lu yi kyamate ɛmɛ eko umba Osera te akwiyi gba lu wo ongbulolo, bɔkɔ lu nyama te onzu le lo yi iyi mo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Lunyi anumbeko, la lu wo bɛtɛ mbala eko yi tete, la lu wo mbo kyamate enzu umbopo yi umba bɔkɔ a kɔma mo tayi. Tete la lu lo mbo mo kwuwongu lunyi kya luu na esheshi iyi kwunyɔ ungwu Ukpo be shi yi awu, kaa kiya la ki fo Ukpo ilɛma yi ma mo.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyashi Imama Kwuwongwu Esheshi Iwomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Imbwambwa yi lɛɛbi, la lu ŋɔ ma mbala esu moloto; la lu ma eyembembyi iyesu, la lu gyesu kyamate imɛnɛ tayi, la lu ma inyashi iyi esu ba la lu gyi ɛnwu yi ma. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />La lu wa kwosa ungwu ira iyi bɔkɔ onzu e wo yi mo, nana ari iyi bɔkɔ o pe yi, a ba kwu tayi de ba wo wu wu iyeshi, moo kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba Ukpa a ŋa yi le kaa la lu fya iyeshi. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te la fya ɔnyɛ ma mu iŋɔma wu, le yi kenzu wu kwuwo, le so iso iyi ira nana kwukyoro mo. <verse eid="1PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Akwu ɛga kaa la lafya la iyira kaa le wo iyeshi; la gagyi iŋɔma iyi oloto mbala enzu lɛɛbi akwɛyi la mbwa lu yi. <verse eid="1PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Moo Ukpo a bɔ eyi mu enzu umba ototo midu wu akwɛyi a pwa kwoya mba, ishi enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo iyira ba Ukpo e towo mbo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Akwiyi gba ŋɔ yi egbo iyi iyeshi iwomo onzu u wo ŋɔ iyira e yi mo. <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Akwiyi gba ŋɔ ma inyashi kwuwongu ŋɔ wo iyeshi de ba ŋɔ fya iyeshi ma mbaa Ukpo. Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee &lt;&lt; Uŋɔ ki riyi mbo mo; uŋɔ ki pulama mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Akwiyi gba egbo ŋɔ i shi ngboro te Okrasi gba akwu Ɔkwu le, koko ka yi ɛnwu ma iyi ŋɔ bi gba opwu la umba bɔkɔ o bo yo ŋɔ kwuyo kwuwongu eyi iyi ŋɔ fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi awu. Uŋɔ ba gba opwu toto la iyi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Egbo yi lakwu iruwu, kaa umba bɔkɔ o so ungwoyi yi kwuwongu luzɛ undu esheshi undu Okrasi imbwaluma awu, lovya la lu yi mbo mo kwuwongu iso iyi ira mba ɛnyi. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Akwiyi gba Ukpo a nyama ka ma inyashi kwuwongu esheshi iyi ŋɔ wo, i shoshi i kaa inyashi i mama kwuwongu ira iyi ŋɔ wo awu. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Okrasi e kpomo kwuzhikpɛnyi kwuwongu ingbomo iyi enzu lɛɛbi, onzu uwu ototo e kpomo kwuwongu enzu umbira, kaa le so ye mbaa Ukpo. O ngbɛ wu ma mɛnwu ba o gba wa lakwunyɔ ishimo mu kwundu, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />a zɛ mu ɛndu a ka tanu la ɛndu mu aleku. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Ɛndu ɛlɛ i lomo la Ukpo mo mekyekyi, Ukpo ba e yidu a ŋɔ e gbo mbo, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Onowa e yi mu kwɔda ikpomo awu. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o fye mɛmi iyi kwoda o yi bwɛɛ bi, akwu enzu waranda gba Ukpo a sa mba ma mu embyi le. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Embyi mbamba o yi mate obatisima uwu bɔkɔ a sa yi ma kekelele, akwu ɛnyinyi iyi ɛnwu igbɔma mo, akwu ka lo nyɔlɔ iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi. Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e yimo mu kuvɔ, mu ɛlɛ gba o sa yi ma le. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a ka moshi-e, e yi mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu Ukpo. Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbala enzu umba idomo mbala umba ekpasu lɛɛbi o yi mu kwuwo wu.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wambwalu Ɔzhizɔsi Lo Wo Iyi Bɔkɔ I She La Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Kyamate bɔkɔ Okrasi a ma inyashi awu, lunyi tete la lu ka ɛnwu yi ma mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ awu, kwuwongu onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ma inyashi, e kyo mbala ingbomo fo. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, i na mɔnɛ i she keyi, luzɛ ŋɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lakwu undu bɔkɔ ɛnwu i gyi mo, lakwu undu bɔkɔ Ukpo e to ŋɔ keyi le. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Mekyi lu wo apula iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo o wo. Lu tutu kwuye yi mo mu kaya itomo, ɔnyɛ uwu apula iyira iwomo, lu to ɛnwu yi lu shi atɛ iwomo mbala eshi ibyima. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Akwa mba kiya ingyi kenzu iyama te lunyi lu kyo mbala mba mu apula iyi ingbomo iwomo fo, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ o kpa yi ari. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Umba ba mega o so kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o wo laa Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o degbo la reyi. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Kiya ingyi ki shi bɔkɔ o zɛ ilɔ iyesheshi laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu, gba o zɔ mba ombu mbo kyamate enzu o zɔ lala, kwundu mbo kwu yi moshi mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ O Rala Rɛshi Ingyi Ukpo Marimari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Imbwama iyi apula lɛɛbi i bo-o. Lunyi la lu yi ɛnwu yi ma kaa la lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu lɛ Ukpo. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />I yi bɔkɔ ika ɛlɛ ma lɛɛbi, gba akwu te, la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu, kwuwongu idɛnyi i koko i ngbomo mo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />La lu na esu mu ewo epo, la lu za anu mo. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Wambwalu lo rala rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo awu kaa lo mbwala enzu umbafo ma. Umba lo rala rɛshi ikikɔ ikikɔ ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo awu lo wo ugɔ ma ngyi marimari. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛ ilɔ lo zɛ iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a lɔ mba awu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo kiya laa enzu awu ba lo wo mu ekpasu iyi Ukpo e shi mbo, kaa mekeka iyi apula lɛɛbi iduma laa kwiyi Ukpo i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. inzumbɛku mbala ekpasu la kwiyi Edego-ala iyɔkpɔɔ. Ami.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyashi Imama Kwuwongwu Ɔzhizɔsi Imbwaluma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ɛmɛza mi umba idu mi, la kwa yi kiya ingyi kenzu iyama kwuwongu wɔnu umbu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ lu yi mu imama le mo, kwuwo kwɔngu lunyi la lu ma te akwu kiya ingyepo gba ki du yi le mo. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Lunyi ba la kwa yi kiya ingyi ɔnyɛ te lu kyo mu inyashi iyi Okrasi a ma awu, akwɛyi a kwa yi kiya ingyi ɔnyɛ kwuyengwu inzumbɛku wu i ta nduu. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ukpo e shi yi esheshi akwiyi gba o pe yi kwuwongu Okrasi, ɛlɛ i zɔ te Kwundu uwu inzumbɛku uwu Ukpo e yi ma yi. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Akwiyi gba lu ma inyashi lakwu kwuwongu lu kwu wa ngbɛ enzu naa awɛlɔ naa enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo kenzu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyamba mo mo. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Akwiyi gba lu ma inyashi kwuwongu lu kwu wa mbwalu Okrasi, la kwa yi kiya ingyi lovya mo, lunyi ba la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi te o ya yi o ba la Okrasi. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Moo kwuyengwu ombu izɔma kwu bo-o i yo yoo mu enzu umba kwogba ungwu Ukpo, enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo iso iyi Ukpo ma ba o wo te? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Gba ikɔma laa onzu ototo kaa lo sa wu ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi Ukpo mo mbala onzu uwu ingbomo ba e wo te fo?<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma inyashi kwuwongu inyama iyi Ukpo awu kaa lo gyakpɔɔ mu esheshi iwomo akwɛyi o to ɛnwu mba o ta la Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e wo mbo kaa lo gyakpɔɔ mu esheshi iwomo uwu bɔkɔ ee wo iyi bɔkɔ e so te ee wo awu.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Lo Ra Laa Luzhi Undu Ukpo Marimari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Imi Opita, mi ka yi ɛnwu ma lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu enzu umbakɔ awu, Imi mi kwu onzu uwakɔ mate lunyi tete, imi mi ma inyashi iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi a ma la eyi mi, mi gba mii yi mbala wu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ba zɔ inzumbɛku wu awu, gba mii kpa yi ɛshɛku te <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />la lu bɔ eyi mbaa enzu umba Ukpo kyamate u pya luzhi a bɔ eyi mbaa luzhi wu tayi awu. La lu bɔ mba eyi kyamate enzu o kpa yi mɛgaa tayi mo, lunyi ba la lu wo kwuwongu i she yi te la lu wo tayi moo ɛlɛ tegba Ukpo a gyi le; la lu kwu enzu umba ekweyi iyi eduwo mo, la lu wo ɛduma mu egbo yi ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e lo yi yi mu kwuwo awu, la lu wo mbo kyamate enye mo, lunyi la lu zɔ mba ari iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ umba o do te o vɔngɔ munyi yi. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Gba lu wo ɛlɛ, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi u to keyi uwu enzu lɛɛbi a ba gbama awu, luu na ɛnuma uwu inzumbɛku uwu bɔkɔ a wuma gbee mo.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Lunyi alugbaga tete, la lu lomo la enzu umbakɔ. Lunyi la lu kwu enzu umba egbo mɛzhi mu luzɛ yi mbala esu, kwuwongu, o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te, &lt;&lt;Ukpo a gyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba o fulo kadu mo, enzu umba egbo mɛzhi ba a zɔ mba esheshi wu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu gba la ɛyi mɛzhi mu idu iyi Ukpo Edego-ala nzu uwu ekpasu, akwɛyi uwu ba e yi yi mo moshi mu kwuye wu. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />La lu ra la egbo gidigidi yi la lu lo wu mɔwu, kwuwongu e pwu idɛnyi yi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />La lu yi ɛyi ma, la lu rima agiri, moo onzu uwoyi ogewa yi e yi mu oga ibyima kyamate ɔbaga uwu e yi mu onzu igagyima kaa le kwu tayi. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Lunyi ba la lu nyama kaa la lu shi wu ɔgwuzɛ mo, kwuwongu lu yitu te, ɛmanyi yi wa mbwalu munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o yi mu inyashi ɛlɛ te imama tete.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi enzu wu esheshi awu, uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma kaa la lu fya inzumbɛku iyɔkpɔɔ kya mbala Okrasi awu, gba lu ma inyashi iyi kwuye bwɛ, uwu aa gba yi luu kwu enzu umbepo, akwɛyi ee shi yi ekpasu iyi luu rima ngiri ba lu wo akpa mo. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ekpasu akwiyi Ukpo iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Osalasi umɛza mi, umɛnɛ u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ureyi, gba a mbwa mi ma mu kwupu ungwɛri kwɔlɛ ikama le, kaa la ki ka yi ɛnwu ma, la ki gba la ki za yi tee,ɛlɛ gba akwu esheshi ireyi iyi Ukpo le. La lu ra la iso ɛnyi gbagiri.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Wambwalu umba Ɔbabilɔ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba kyamate bɔkɔ o ŋa yi awu mbala umɛ mi Omaki, o ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />La lu gbɛlɛ esu ɛnyi, la lu kpa esu idu iyi i zɔ te lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Mii lɛ Ukpo te le shi yi wa mbwalu Okrasi iŋɔma iyi oloto lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>